---
// Cursus-teaser als filmisch full-bleed blok
---
<section class="ct">
  <div class="ct-media" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1473968512647-3e447244af8f?w=2400&q=78&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="" loading="lazy" />
    <div class="ct-veil"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap ct-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow reveal">De Vluchtfilmer</p>
    <h2 class="ct-title reveal">Leer je drone <span class="refract">filmen</span>,<br>niet alleen vliegen.</h2>
    <p class="ct-sub reveal">
      Vijftien modules van eerste opstart tot afgemonteerde film. Echte voorbeelden,
      shot-recepten en het denken van een filmmaker.
    </p>
    <div class="ct-cta reveal">
      <a href="/cursus/" class="btn-film">Start de cursus →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ct { position: relative; height: 90svh; min-height: 520px; display: flex; align-items: center; overflow: hidden; }
  .ct-media { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; }
  .ct-media img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .ct-veil {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,0,0,.78) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,.4) 45%, transparent 75%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg), transparent 18%, transparent 82%, var(--bg));
  }
  .ct-inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; color: #fff; }
  .ct .eyebrow { color: rgba(255,255,255,.7); margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  .ct-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 4.4rem); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.03em;
    line-height: 1.02; margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
    text-shadow: 0 4px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
  }
  .ct-sub { font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.3rem); color: rgba(255,255,255,.85); max-width: 48ch; margin-bottom: 2.2rem; }
  .btn-film {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: .95rem 1.8rem;
    border-radius: 999px; background: #fff; color: #0a0a0c;
    font-weight: 600; font-size: 1rem;
    transition: transform .3s var(--ease), box-shadow .3s var(--ease);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 40px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
  }
  .btn-film:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .ct { height: auto; min-height: 80svh; padding-block: 5rem; }
    .ct-veil {
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,.6), rgba(0,0,0,.35) 40%, rgba(0,0,0,.65)),
        linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg), transparent 14%, transparent 86%, var(--bg));
    }
  }
</style>
